# .testmuai/ holds live GuardianKane/Kane state. Most of it stays untracked
# (raw browser-evidence packs, an old-org backup dir) but the small files
# the dashboard actually reads (kane-activity.log, task-tracker.md,
# graph.json, config) are committed on purpose — that's what makes
# `npm run dashboard` show real history immediately after a fresh clone,
# instead of an empty dashboard.
.testmuai/evidence/
.testmuai/tests-old-org-backup/
.testmuai/tests/
.context/
.context.old-org-3281823-backup/
